(02 Request and approval process) Tj
0 -18 Td
() Tj
0 -18 Td
(An employee may request vacation up to the available balance.) Tj
0 -18 Td
(The request should include the start date, end date and a contact plan.) Tj
0 -18 Td
(The direct manager reviews staffing impact and records an approval or rejection.) Tj
0 -18 Td
(People Operations reviews requests that exceed the available balance.) Tj
0 -18 Td
() Tj
0 -18 Td
(People Operations review is also required when the request:) Tj
0 -18 Td
(- overlaps a leave period;) Tj
0 -18 Td
(- approaches a contract end date; or) Tj
0 -18 Td
(- requires an exception to a local scheduling rule.) Tj
0 -18 Td
() Tj
0 -18 Td
(Approval is not an automatic employment action. An authorized reviewer) Tj
0 -18 Td
(records the final decision and the decision date in the HRIS.) Tj
